  "Description": "Unleashes a bolt of electro-magnetic energy that deals <span style=\"color:\n#FDC038\">Electric DMG</span> and <span class=\"glossary\" data-desc=\"[[File:Electric Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#FFCC00'&gt;Electric Infliction&lt;/span&gt; is a type of &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;Arts Infliction&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Up to 4 stacks of [[File:Electric Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#FFCC00'&gt;Electric Infliction&lt;/span&gt; can be applied and stacking triggers &lt;span style='color:#FFCC00'&gt;Electric Burst&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;br&gt;A &lt;span style='color:#33C2FF'&gt;non-Electric Infliction&lt;/span&gt; ([[File:Heat Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]/[[File:Cryo Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]/[[File:Nature Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]) + [[File:Electric Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#FFCC00'&gt;Electric Infliction&lt;/span&gt; = [[File:Electrification icon.png|15px|link=]]&lt;span style='color:#FFCC00'&gt;Electrification&lt;/span&gt;\" data-title=\"Arts Infliction: Electric\" data-color=\"7\" data-name=\"Electric Infliction\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#FDC038\">[[File:Electric Infliction icon.png|15px|link=]][[Electric Infliction|<span style=\"color:#FDC038\">Electric Infliction</span>]]</span> to enemies in a small area."
 },
